WEBVTT

NOTE Nosferatu (1922) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
[music]

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.740
[German title cards, translated]
Based on the novel "Dracula" by
Bram Stoker. Freely adapted by
Henrik Galeen.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:26.740
Costumes and sets: Albin Grau.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.740
Cast: Count Orlok: Max Schreck.
Hutter: Gustav v. Wangenheim.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:44.740
Ellen, his wife: Greta
Schroeder. Harding, a shipowner:
G. H. Schnell.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:53.090
Ruth, his sister: Ruth
Landshoff. Professor Sievers,
the town doctor: Gustav Botz.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:01:01.490
Knock, an estate agent:
Alexander Granach.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:08.740
Professor Bulwer, a Paracelsian:
John Gottowt. A captain: Max
Nemetz.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:15.990
First sailor: Wolfgang Heinz.
Second sailor: Albert Venohr.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Act I.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:15.750
"Why did you kill them...
the lovely flowers?!"

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:42.000
"Not so hasty, young friend!
No one escapes his fate."

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:14.750
"Count Orlok — his lordship...
from Transylvania... wishes to
buy a fine house in our little
town..."

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:22.750
"You could earn a
nice lump of money..."

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:38.500
"...it will cost a little
trouble... a little sweat and
perhaps... a little blood..."

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.250
"He wants a really
fine, desolate house..."

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:48.750
"That house... right across
from yours. Offer him that!"

00:07:51.000 --> 00:08:00.000
"Travel fast, travel well, young
friend, to the land of
phantoms."

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:26.000
"I'm travelling far, far away,
to the land of thieves and
phantoms."

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.500
"Don't worry."

00:12:55.500 --> 00:13:03.000
"Quick... my meal — I must
get to Count Orlok's castle!"

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:42.500
"You can't go on now. The
werewolf is roaming the
forests."

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.000
"Drive on! The sun is setting!"

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:28.750
"Pay what you like!
We're going no further!"

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:47.500
"We won't drive on! Over
the pass, it isn't safe!"

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:44.750
"You kept me waiting — too long.
It is nearly midnight. The
servants are asleep!"

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:04.750
Nosferatu. Act II.

00:25:04.250 --> 00:25:08.750
"You've hurt yourself...
The precious blood!"

00:31:12.500 --> 00:31:18.750
"Your wife has a lovely neck..."

00:31:28.250 --> 00:31:35.500
"I'll buy the house... the
lovely, desolate house across
from yours..."

00:34:43.750 --> 00:34:46.000
"Ellen!"

00:34:55.000 --> 00:34:58.000
"A doctor... a doctor!"

00:35:24.000 --> 00:35:25.250
"Hutter!"

00:36:28.250 --> 00:36:30.750
"Harmless congestion
of the blood."

00:39:36.000 --> 00:39:37.500
"Ellen! Ellen!!"

00:40:58.000 --> 00:41:01.500
End of Act II.

00:41:14.250 --> 00:41:25.000
"Peasants brought him to the
hospital yesterday. They said he
had fallen. He still has a
fever..."

00:41:39.750 --> 00:41:41.250
"Coffins —"

00:42:33.000 --> 00:42:38.750
"The schooner sails
this very night."

00:45:12.250 --> 00:45:17.250
"Isn't it — just
like a vampire!"

00:45:40.250 --> 00:45:48.000
"The patient brought in
yesterday is having a raving
fit..."

00:46:19.000 --> 00:46:23.750
"Blood is life! Blood is life!"

00:46:58.250 --> 00:47:01.250
"And this one here..."

00:47:04.750 --> 00:47:10.750
"...a polyp with tentacles..."

00:47:19.500 --> 00:47:24.750
"...transparent...
almost bodiless..."

00:47:32.250 --> 00:47:37.750
"...almost nothing
but a phantom..."

00:47:46.250 --> 00:47:49.500
"Spiders...!"

00:51:29.500 --> 00:51:37.500
"No, I must go... home
by the shortest way!"

00:55:01.000 --> 00:55:07.000
"A sailor below deck has fallen
ill. He's raving with fever."

00:57:21.000 --> 00:57:29.500
"I'm going below! If I'm not
back up in ten minutes..."

00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:55.000
End of Act III.

01:01:37.500 --> 01:01:41.750
"I must go to him. He's coming!"

01:03:35.500 --> 01:03:40.750
"The master is near...
The master is near...!"

01:07:36.500 --> 01:07:40.250
"Thank God... you're
safe... All is well now..."

01:09:18.250 --> 01:09:27.000
"Searched everything... Not
a living soul on board."

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:37.000
"Danger of plague! Go home!
Shut all windows and doors!"

01:14:12.250 --> 01:14:16.500
End of Act IV.

01:17:19.000 --> 01:17:25.000
"This is how I see it
— every evening...!"

01:19:01.000 --> 01:19:06.750
"I'll run across...
I'll fetch Sievers..."

01:21:09.000 --> 01:21:16.750
"He's been seen! He ran out of
the house! He strangled the
keeper..."

01:21:25.000 --> 01:21:29.250
"He strangled
him... the vampire!"

01:26:15.500 --> 01:26:18.000
"Bulwer! Fetch Bulwer!"

01:28:09.750 --> 01:28:14.250
"Knock has been caught!"

01:28:54.750 --> 01:28:58.500
"The master... the master...!"

01:30:10.250 --> 01:30:14.000
"The master... is... dead."

01:30:40.500 --> 01:30:43.000
"Hutter!"

01:31:53.000 --> 01:31:58.750
The End.
